    "summary": "Nintendo stock leans on the Zelda: Ocarina of Time remake for the holidays as a player finds a midair jump glitch that could break speedruns.\nThe post Why Nintendo Stock Is One to Watch Ahead of the Holiday Season appeared first on BeInCrypto.",
    "hasSummary": true,
